  "description": "This is the ultimate step through bicycle, with the top tube only six inches from the ground.\n\nOften imitated but never replicated, this is the ultimate step through bicycle, with the top tube only six inches from the ground, and the oversized aluminum frame tubing, gives this bike the toughness and elegance required by the discerning rider. It is equally at home in the park or at the beach giving you styling and performance that cannot be beat! EB Top 3 features an internal 3-speed Shimano Nexus hub with coaster brake. For extra safety, a front hand brake is included.\nHeight recommendations:\n5'1\" to 5'6\" = 40 cm (Only available in Aqua Blue, Aqua green and Pearl White)\n5'7\" to 5'10\" = 46 cm (Only availble in Black)\nFor shorter than 5'1\" see EB e7-24\" and for taller than 5'11\" see e7-700C",
